{"config": {"ok": true, "groups": [{"id": "identity", "label": "🐾 身份", "desc": "决定机器人叫什么、什么性格、开机第一句话说什么。"}, {"id": "llm", "label": "🧠 大模型", "desc": "决定它用哪个模型思考。本地 Ollama 可完全离线，豆包需要联网。"}, {"id": "voice", "label": "🎙️ 语音", "desc": "决定它怎么听、怎么说。听不清或声音奇怪时优先调这里。"}], "fields": [{"key": "pet_name", "label": "宠物名字", "group": "identity", "type": "text", "help": "改名后立即重建人格提示词与面板标题", "desc": "机器人以后对外展示的名字。聊天、打招呼、面板里都会用这个名字。改名后立即生效，不需要重启服务。", "value": "小坦", "saved": false}, {"key": "personality", "label": "人格提示词", "group": "identity", "type": "textarea", "help": "立即重建 System Prompt", "desc": "告诉大模型“它是谁、该怎么说话”的人设。写得越具体，语气越稳定，例如：你是一只活泼的小猫，每次最多回答两句话，喜欢用语气词。留空则使用默认人格。", "value": "活泼友善的编程伙伴，像好朋友一样跟你说话，回答要口语化、简短（30字以内），偶尔用叠词卖萌。", "saved": false}, {"key": "startup_greeting", "label": "开机问候", "group": "identity", "type": "textarea", "help": "下次启动自动播报的文本", "desc": "服务启动后自动朗读的第一句话，用来做开场介绍。留空表示启动时不主动说话。修改后下次启动才生效。", "value": "你好，我是小坦，是你的编程伙伴，很高兴见到你！", "saved": false}, {"key": "llm_backend", "label": "LLM 后端", "group": "llm", "type": "select", "options": ["ollama", "doubao"], "help": "ollama = 板子本地模型；doubao = 云端模型", "desc": "决定由谁生成回复。ollama：模型跑在板子本地，断网也能用，但速度较慢；doubao：云端大模型，更聪明，需要联网并填写 API Key。", "value": "ollama", "saved": false}, {"key": "ollama_host", "label": "Ollama 地址", "group": "llm", "type": "text", "help": "本机默认 http://localhost:11434；模型跑在别的电脑上时填那台电脑的 IP", "desc": "本地 Ollama 服务的地址。默认 http://127.0.0.1:11434 表示模型跑在同一块板子上；如果模型跑在另一台电脑，填那台电脑的局域网 IP，例如 http://192.168.1.10:11434。", "when": {"field": "llm_backend", "in": ["ollama"]}, "value": "http://localhost:11434", "saved": false}, {"key": "ollama_model", "label": "Ollama 模型", "group": "llm", "type": "text", "help": "如 qwen2.5:0.5b / qwen2.5:1.5b", "desc": "要使用的本地模型名称，必须是 Ollama 里已经下载过的名字。qwen2.5:0.5b 更快、占用小；qwen2.5:1.5b 更聪明但更吃内存。名字填错时对话会直接报错。", "when": {"field": "llm_backend", "in": ["ollama"]}, "value": "qwen2.5:0.5b", "saved": false}, {"key": "doubao_api_key", "label": "豆包 API Key", "group": "llm", "type": "password", "secret": true, "help": "留空表示不修改; 保存后只回显掩码", "desc": "豆包/火山引擎开放平台的 API Key，相当于云端模型的登录密码。只保存在板子本地，面板只显示后 4 位。留空表示保持原来的 Key 不变。", "when": {"field": "llm_backend", "in": ["doubao"]}, "value": "", "is_set": false, "masked": "", "saved": false}, {"key": "doubao_model", "label": "豆包模型", "group": "llm", "type": "text", "help": "按账号实际开通的模型填写，如 doubao-pro-32k / doubao-lite-4k", "desc": "豆包侧要调用的模型名称或推理接入点 ID，需要和你在火山引擎控制台创建的一致。只有 LLM 后端选 doubao 时才会用到。", "when": {"field": "llm_backend", "in": ["doubao"]}, "value": "doubao-pro-32k", "saved": false}, {"key": "llm_temperature", "label": "回答发散度 (温度)", "group": "llm", "type": "number", "min": 0, "max": 2, "step": 0.05, "help": "0 最稳定、2 最放飞。小模型建议 0.5~0.8，避免胡言乱语", "desc": "控制回答的随机程度。0 最稳定，几乎每次一样；0.7 比较自然；1 以上更发散，也更容易跑题。小模型建议 0.5~0.8。", "when": {"field": "llm_backend", "in": ["ollama", "doubao"]}, "value": 0.7, "saved": false}, {"key": "llm_num_predict", "label": "单次最长回复 (token)", "group": "llm", "type": "number", "min": 16, "max": 512, "step": 1, "help": "越大回复越长也越慢。树莓派小模型建议 100~200", "desc": "单次回复最多生成多少 token，越大回答越完整，但等待时间越长。树莓派上的小模型建议 100~200，避免一句话等太久。", "when": {"field": "llm_backend", "in": ["ollama", "doubao"]}, "value": 96, "saved": false}, {"key": "llm_timeout", "label": "模型请求超时 (秒)", "group": "llm", "type": "number", "min": 10, "max": 600, "step": 5, "help": "板子慢或模型大时调大，避免回答到一半被判超时", "desc": "等待模型回复的最长时间，超过就判定失败。本地模型首次加载会慢一些，可以调到 180~300 秒；云端通常 30 秒就够。", "when": {"field": "llm_backend", "in": ["ollama", "doubao"]}, "value": 180.0, "saved": false}, {"key": "tts_mode", "label": "发音方式 (TTS)", "group": "voice", "type": "select", "options": ["edge", "piper", "espeak", "pyttsx3"], "help": "edge = 云端自然童声（需联网）；piper = 本地离线童声；espeak = 机械音兜底", "desc": "机器人怎么发声。edge：微软云端自然童声，最像小朋友，但需要联网；piper：本地离线童声，断网也能说；espeak：系统机械音，作为兜底；pyttsx3：系统自带语音引擎。", "value": "piper", "saved": false}, {"key": "tts_voice", "label": "edge 音色", "group": "voice", "type": "text", "help": "zh-CN-XiaoyiNeural 女童 / zh-CN-YunxiaNeural 男童", "desc": "edge 模式使用的音色。zh-CN-XiaoyiNeural 是女童音，zh-CN-YunxiaNeural 是男童音。只有发音方式选 edge 时生效。", "when": {"field": "tts_mode", "in": ["edge"]}, "value": "zh-CN-XiaoyiNeural", "saved": false}, {"key": "tts_pitch", "label": "edge 音调", "group": "voice", "type": "text", "help": "如 +15Hz, 调高更像小朋友", "desc": "edge 模式的音调偏移，例如 +15Hz 会更高、更像小朋友。调太高可能失真，一般用 +10Hz 到 +30Hz。", "when": {"field": "tts_mode", "in": ["edge"]}, "value": "+15Hz", "saved": false}, {"key": "tts_device", "label": "播放设备", "group": "voice", "type": "text", "help": "留空自动探测 USB 声卡; 如 plughw:CARD=UACDemoV10,DEV=0", "desc": "声音从哪块声卡播放。留空会自动寻找 USB 声卡；如果插了多个声卡、或机器人在跑但没声音，可以在这里指定设备名，例如 plughw:CARD=UACDemoV10,DEV=0。", "when": {"field": "tts_mode", "in": ["edge", "piper", "espeak", "pyttsx3"]}, "value": "", "saved": false}, {"key": "piper_pitch", "label": "Piper 变调", "group": "voice", "type": "number", "min": 0.8, "max": 1.6, "step": 0.01, "help": "1.0 原声, 越大越像小孩", "desc": "离线童声的变调倍数。1.0 是原声，1.1~1.3 更接近小朋友。改完下一句话就会生效。", "when": {"field": "tts_mode", "in": ["piper"]}, "value": 1.15, "saved": false}, {"key": "edge_timeout", "label": "云端合成超时 (秒)", "group": "voice", "type": "number", "min": 2, "max": 60, "step": 1, "help": "超时自动降级本地 piper", "desc": "云端语音合成最多等多久。网络慢或超时会自动改用本地 piper，避免机器人突然不说话。网络不好时适当调大。", "when": {"field": "tts_mode", "in": ["edge"]}, "value": 10.0, "saved": false}, {"key": "asr_device", "label": "麦克风设备", "group": "voice", "type": "text", "help": "留空自动探测; 可填序号或名字片段", "desc": "用哪个麦克风收音。留空自动寻找 USB 麦克风；如果有多个麦克风，或机器人听不到声音，可以填设备序号（如 1）或名字片段（如 USB）。", "value": "", "saved": false}, {"key": "vad_threshold_max", "label": "起录灵敏度上限", "group": "voice", "type": "number", "min": 0.005, "max": 0.2, "step": 0.005, "help": "越小越灵敏, 环境嘈杂时调大", "desc": "多大声才算“开始说话”的上限。数值越小越灵敏，安静环境可调小；风扇、空调噪声大时调大，避免把噪声当成说话。", "value": 0.02, "saved": false}, {"key": "vad_speech_ms", "label": "连续有声起录 (ms)", "group": "voice", "type": "number", "min": 50, "max": 1000, "step": 50, "desc": "声音要连续持续多久才正式开录。太短容易把咳嗽、碰桌子当成说话；太长可能吃掉开头一两个字。200ms 适合大多数情况。", "value": 100, "saved": false}, {"key": "vad_silence_ms", "label": "静音结束 (ms)", "group": "voice", "type": "number", "min": 300, "max": 3000, "step": 100, "desc": "说完之后安静多久算一句话结束。太短会把句子截断，太长会让机器人反应变慢。一般 1000~1500ms。", "value": 600, "saved": false}]}, "schema": {"version": 1, "categories": [{"id": "event", "label": "事件", "colour": "#eab308"}, {"id": "motion", "label": "运动", "colour": "#3b82f6"}, {"id": "ptz", "label": "云台", "colour": "#06b6d4"}, {"id": "action", "label": "动作", "colour": "#8b5cf6"}, {"id": "face", "label": "表情", "colour": "#a855f7"}, {"id": "speech", "label": "说话", "colour": "#ec4899"}, {"id": "sense", "label": "识别", "colour": "#22c55e"}, {"id": "control", "label": "控制", "colour": "#f97316"}], "blocks": [{"type": "event_start", "category": "event", "blockly": {"type": "event_start", "message0": "当程序开始", "nextStatement": null, "colour": "#eab308", "hat": "cap", "tooltip": "程序从这里开始运行"}}, {"type": "move_for", "category": "motion", "blockly": {"type": "move_for", "message0": "向 %1 以速度 %2 移动 %3 秒", "args0": [{"type": "field_dropdown", "name": "DIR", "options": [["前进", "forward"], ["后退", "backward"], ["左移", "leftSlide"], ["右移", "rightSlide"], ["左转", "turnLeft"], ["右转", "turnRight"], ["原地旋转", "spin"]]}, {"type": "field_number", "name": "SPEED", "value": 150, "min": 50, "max": 255, "precision": 1}, {"type": "field_number", "name": "SECONDS", "value": 1, "min": 0.1, "max": 30, "precision": 0.1}], "previousStatement": null, "nextStatement": null, "inputsInline": true, "colour": "#3b82f6", "tooltip": "按方向移动一段时间后自动停止"}}, {"type": "move_stop", "category": "motion", "blockly": {"type": "move_stop", "message0": "停止运动", "previousStatement": null, "nextStatement": null, "colour": "#3b82f6", "tooltip": "立即停止底盘"}}, {"type": "look", "category": "ptz", "blockly": {"type": "look", "message0": "云台向 %1 转动 %2 度", "args0": [{"type": "field_dropdown", "name": "DIR", "options": [["向上", "up"], ["向下", "down"], ["向左", "left"], ["向右", "right"], ["回正", "center"]]}, {"type": "field_number", "name": "DEGREES", "value": 10, "min": 1, "max"